# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# RADIATION .gitignore — landed 2026-09-13 (P-10 Phase 0, containment patch)
# Purpose: make accidental publication of vehicles, binaries, and credentials
#          IMPOSSIBLE rather than merely discouraged.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── 1. CREDENTIALS — never, under any circumstance ───────────────────────────
# A Blackboard/LMS external-calendar feed URL grants full read access to the
# Commander's course calendar. It is a credential (P-10 §3.2). It enters no
# file that git can see.
schedule/
schedul*.txt
*ics.txt
*.ics
*.ical

# ── 2. VEHICLES — the documents are read and extracted, never committed ──────
# II.6 restraint doctrine, rule 8 (delete-the-binary, staged under P-04).
# The repo holds what the Commander KNOWS; vehicles stay on his machine.
syllabi/
courses_raw/
Brain/courses/_local/
*.pdf
*.docx
*.doc
*.pptx
*.xlsx
*.html
*.htm
SCHEDULE.png
desktop.ini
Thumbs.db

# ── 2b. DERIVED WORKING FILES — regenerable, and schedule-derived ────────────
# The planner writes briefs and an ICS snapshot here. They are regenerable, and
# the snapshot is schedule-derived, so neither belongs in the repository record.
Brain/short_term/plan/*.local.md
Brain/short_term/plan/*.local.json
*.local.md
*.local.json

# ── 3. ARCHIVES & PATCHES — transported, not stored ─────────────────────────
*.zip
PATCH_*.zip
RADIATION_PATCH_*.zip

# ── 3b. LOCAL SCRATCH — re-homed vehicles, patch notes, backups ─────────────
# Created by APPLY.sh. The vehicles the repository must not hold live here,
# on the Commander's machine, exactly where they belong.
_local_backup/

# ── 3c. GENERATED VALIDATOR OUTPUT (added patch 2600) ───────────────────────
# scripts/validate.py writes this file on EVERY run (line ~461). It was tracked,
# so every validation produced a repo diff of a file nobody reads in a diff.
# Untrack once with:  git rm --cached validation_report.json
validation_report.json

# ── 4. WORKING NOISE ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
node_modules/

# ── 3d. PATCH TRANSPORT (patch 3600) — apply runners are transport, not record ──
# They ship in zips, run once, and should never re-enter history (they kept getting
# committed). IGNORED so extraction noise dies; APPLY still runs them from disk.
APPLY.sh
APPLY.ps1
PATCH_NOTES.md
Brain/courses/SCHEDULE.csv
Brain/courses/0_CALLENDER/readme.txt


# ── 3e. LOCAL RUNTIME (patch 4400) — task bundles live committed under evidence/;
# runtime/ is the local working area the remediation plan reserves (gitignored)
runtime/

# 5500 gate review: DECLARED corpus assets are never ignored — the restored
# source files must seal (gitignore had banned binary vehicle types; declared
# entries are exempt by Commander ruling, and an unsealed declaration lies).
!Brain/courses/DSS10_INTRODUCTION_TO_DATA_SCIENCE/*.docx
!Brain/courses/GED103_READINGS_IN_PHILIPPINE_HISTORY/*.docx
!Brain/courses/MEC30-7_STATICS_OF_RIGID_BODIES_FOR_CE/*.html
